      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 6]"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_sub045_rival_06",
      "hash": "224b5b60e97a1434",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 7]"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_sub045_rival_07",
      "hash": "224b5c60e97a15e7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 8]"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_sub045_rival_08",
      "hash": "224b5160e97a0336",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 9]"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_sub045_rival_15",
      "hash": "224e5a60e97c4858",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR RIVALNAME(0001)]: Hey, [VAR TRNAME(0000)]!"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_sub045_rival_09",
      "hash": "224b5260e97a04e9",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "Oh!\\nWait, don’t tell me..."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_sub045_rival_10",
      "hash": "224e5f60e97c50d7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "You already caught that superstrong Pokémon,\\ndidn’t you?\\c\\nI knew it!\\nSo, it’s called Mewtwo, huh?"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_sub045_rival_11",
      "hash": "224e5e60e97c4f24",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Man, you got to Mewtwo before me or that girl!"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_sub045_rival_12",
      "hash": "224e6160e97c543d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Huh? Oh, I ran into this gutsy girl who said she\\nwas looking for a powerful Pokémon.\\c\\nI think she meant Mewtwo."
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_sub045_rival_13",
      "hash": "224e6060e97c528a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Well, I guess that’s that...\\c\\nHere, take these. I won’t need ’em now!"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "id": "msg_sub045_sys_04",
      "hash": "b6ff44bfe64fc451",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "You got 3 Escape Ropes\\nfrom [VAR TRNAME(0001)]!"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "id": "msg_sub045_rival_14",
      "hash": "224e5b60e97c4a0b",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "I just saw that girl come in here, too.\\nShe must still be looking for Mewtwo.\\c\\nYou should go show it to her!"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "id": "msg_sub045_sys_02",
      "hash": "b6ff46bfe64fc7b7",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "Ow!\\c\\nYou were hit by a low-flying Poké Ball!"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "id": "msg_sub045_blue_01",
      "hash": "ac93e8d6b44fc90b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "???: Oh, whoops!\\nYou’re not a Pokémon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "id": "msg_sub045_blue_02",
      "hash": "ac93e9d6b44fcabe",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Sorry, it’s so dark in here, I saw you and thought\\nyou were some kind of Pokémon."
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "id": "msg_sub045_blue_03",
      "hash": "ac93ead6b44fcc71",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "GREEN: Well, uh...\\nNice to meet you. I’m Green!"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "id": "msg_sub045_blue_04",
      "hash": "ac93ebd6b44fce24",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "So, hey, I’m just curious...\\nAre you here because you’re also looking for...\\r\\ny’know, something special?"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "id": "msg_sub045_blue_05",
      "hash": "ac93ecd6b44fcfd7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "R-right! Mewtwo!"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "id": "msg_sub045_blue_06",
      "hash": "ac93edd6b44fd18a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "...Drat, so you knew about it already, huh."
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "id": "msg_sub045_blue_07",
      "hash": "ac93eed6b44fd33d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "... ... ..."
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "id": "msg_sub045_blue_17",
      "hash": "ac976ed6b452e294",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Whaaaaaaaaaat?!\\nYou’ve already caught it?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "id": "msg_sub045_blue_08",
      "hash": "ac93dfd6b44fb9c0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Hey, no fair!\\nI was planning on catching it first!"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "id": "msg_sub045_blue_09",
      "hash": "ac93e0d6b44fbb73",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Wow, you’re strong!\\c\\nWell, I guess that’s that.\\nHere, you can have these."
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "id": "msg_sub045_sys_01",
      "hash": "b6ff47bfe64fc96a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "You got a [VAR COLOR(0006)]Mewtwonite X[VAR COLOR(0000)] and a [VAR COLOR(0006)]Mewtwonite Y[VAR COLOR(0000)]!"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "id": "msg_sub045_blue_10",
      "hash": "ac976dd6b452e0e1",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "Oh, I know!\\c\\nWhy don’t you become one of my Pokémon,\\ntogether with Mewtwo?"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "id": "msg_sub045_sys_03",
      "hash": "b6ff45bfe64fc604",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "A Poké Ball came flying at you!"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "id": "msg_sub045_blue_11",
      "hash": "ac976cd6b452df2e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "GREEN: Hee hee hee..."
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "id": "msg_sub045_blue_12",
      "hash": "ac976bd6b452dd7b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Think about it, OK?"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "id": "msg_sub045_blue_13",
      "hash": "ac976ad6b452dbc8",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "GREEN: Drat, I couldn’t catch you this time\\neither, huh..."
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "id": "msg_sub045_blue_14",
      "hash": "ac9771d6b452e7ad",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Well, never mind.\\nJust show me how strong you’ve gotten!"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "id": "msg_sub045_blue_15",
      "hash": "ac9770d6b452e5fa",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Wow, I think you’re plenty strong already!\\c\\nSo, what do you say? Don’t you think it’s time\\nyou become one of my Pokémon?\\c\\nAlong with Mewtwo, of course!"
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "id": "msg_sub045_blue_16",
      "hash": "ac976fd6b452e447",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "I’m not going to give up, you know!"
    }
  ],
